<title>USA: Acushnet, Mass., won by Fleet Sec..</title>
<headline>Acushnet, Mass., won by Fleet Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Sec. said it won $7.325 million of Acushnet, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.26 percent.</p>
</text>
